{"id":"A2-L106","title":"Relative clauses: practice and contrast","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U07","focus":"Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — prática e contraste","pron":"Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["phone repair","cracked screen","protective case","shop hours","quick fix","early customer","phone glass","warranty paper","honest review","shop counter","repair queue","phone owner","fix price","screen glass","store review","repair slip"],"field":"Problemas simples","genre":"Resenha / review","skill":"Escuta","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 106 · Relative clauses: practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Basic relative clauses (who, that, which) — prática e contraste.","**Pronúncia:** Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados.","**16 palavras novas** (problemas simples).","**Texto do dia:** resenha / review."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contrastar who, which e that numa resenha."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["phone repair","conserto de celular"],["cracked screen","tela trincada"],["protective case","capa protetora"],["shop hours","horário da loja"],["quick fix","conserto rápido"],["early customer","cliente madrugador"],["phone glass","vidro do celular"],["warranty paper","papel da garantia"],["honest review","resenha honesta"],["shop counter","shop counter"],["repair queue","repair queue"],["phone owner","phone owner"],["fix price","fix price"],["screen glass","screen glass"],["store review","store review"],["repair slip","repair slip"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A review","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Review: Fix-It Phone Shop ★★★★☆","paras":["The technician **who** helped me was friendly. He repaired the screen, **which** was cracked, and gave me a case **that** protects it. The shop, **which** opens at nine, is near the bus stop.","The only thing **that** I didn’t like was the wait. People **who** arrive early wait less."],"kicker":"SHOP REVIEW","by":"Mel, 4 stars","gloss":[["screen","tela"],["case","capa"],["protect","proteger"],["wait","espera"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The technician was friendly.","ans":"T","why":"was friendly."},{"q":"The shop opens at noon.","ans":"F","why":"opens at nine."},{"q":"Early customers wait less.","ans":"T","why":"arrive early wait less."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“protect” = ?","opts":["proteger","prometer","provar"],"ans":0,"why":"protect."},{"q":"“wait” (nome) = ?","opts":["espera","peso","vela"],"ans":0,"why":"wait."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"who / which / that: contrast","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pronome","Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["who","pessoa","**The technician who helped me.**"],["which","coisa (com vírgula)","**The screen, which was cracked.**"],["that","essencial, sem vírgula","**A case that protects it.**"]],"cap":"who / which / that: contrast"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**which** com vírgulas dá informação extra; **that** sem vírgula é essencial. Pode omitir o pronome se for objeto: *the case (that) he gave me.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The technician ___ helped me was kind. (who)","a":"who","why":"pessoa."},{"s":"The screen, ___ was cracked, is fixed. (which)","a":"which","why":"extra."},{"s":"A case ___ protects it. (that)","a":"that","why":"essencial."},{"s":"The shop, ___ opens at nine, is near. (which)","a":"which","why":"extra."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["phone repair","conserto de celular"],["cracked screen","tela trincada"],["protective case","capa protetora"],["bus stop","ponto de ônibus"],["shop hours","horário da loja"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["phone","Who","fixed","my"],"ans":"Who fixed my phone","pt":"Quem consertou meu celular?"},{"words":["technician","who","works","here","The"],"ans":"The technician who works here","pt":"O técnico que trabalha aqui."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"phone repair","pos":"word","pt":"conserto de celular","ex":"Phone repair.","expt":"Conserto de celular."},{"w":"cracked screen","pos":"word","pt":"tela trincada","ex":"A cracked screen.","expt":"Uma tela trincada."},{"w":"protective case","pos":"word","pt":"capa protetora","ex":"A protective case.","expt":"Uma capa protetora."},{"w":"shop hours","pos":"word","pt":"horário da loja","ex":"Shop hours.","expt":"Horário da loja."},{"w":"quick fix","pos":"word","pt":"conserto rápido","ex":"A quick fix.","expt":"Um conserto rápido."},{"w":"early customer","pos":"word","pt":"cliente madrugador","ex":"An early customer.","expt":"Um cliente madrugador."},{"w":"phone glass","pos":"word","pt":"vidro do celular","ex":"Phone glass.","expt":"Vidro do celular."},{"w":"warranty paper","pos":"word","pt":"papel da garantia","ex":"Warranty paper.","expt":"Papel da garantia."},{"w":"honest review","pos":"word","pt":"resenha honesta","ex":"An honest review.","expt":"Uma resenha honesta."},{"w":"shop counter","pos":"word","pt":"shop counter","ex":"balcão da loja","expt":"Shop counter."},{"w":"repair queue","pos":"word","pt":"repair queue","ex":"fila de conserto","expt":"Repair queue."},{"w":"phone owner","pos":"word","pt":"phone owner","ex":"dono do celular","expt":"Phone owner."},{"w":"fix price","pos":"word","pt":"fix price","ex":"preço do conserto","expt":"Fix price."},{"w":"screen glass","pos":"word","pt":"screen glass","ex":"vidro da tela","expt":"Screen glass."},{"w":"store review","pos":"word","pt":"store review","ex":"avaliação da loja","expt":"Store review."},{"w":"repair slip","pos":"word","pt":"repair slip","ex":"comprovante de conserto","expt":"Repair slip."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Who fixed my phone?** — Quem consertou meu celular?","**The technician who works here.** — O técnico que trabalha aqui.","**And the case, which one is it?** — E a capa, qual é?","**Mind your own business.** — Cuide da sua vida.","**In hot water.** — Em apuros.","**In the long run.** — A longo prazo.","**In the nick of time.** — Em cima da hora."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"calm","pt":"acalmar","forms":[["I / you / we / they calm","I calm the baby."],["he / she / it calms","She calms him."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the shop","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the shop","lines":[["Mel","Who fixed my phone?","Quem consertou meu celular?"],["Clerk","The technician who works here.","O técnico que trabalha aqui."],["Mel","And the case, which one is it?","E a capa, qual é?"],["Clerk","The one that protects the screen.","A que protege a tela."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados","items":[{"label":"Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe a person with who.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"The clerk who helped me was kind."},{"q":"Add extra info with which.","pt":"Acrescente.","model":"The shop, which opens at nine, is near."},{"q":"Use that for essential info.","pt":"Use.","model":"The case that I bought is blue."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 5-line review with relative clauses.","model":"The technician who helped me was friendly. He repaired the screen, which was cracked. He gave me a case that protects it. The shop, which opens at nine, is near the bus stop. People who arrive early wait less.","checklist":["Usei **who / which / that**","Vírgulas corretas","Resenha clara"],"words":"5 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “phone repair” mean?","opts":["tela trincada","ponto de ônibus","conserto de celular"],"ans":2,"why":"**phone repair** = conserto de celular."},{"q":"What does “cracked screen” mean?","opts":["tela trincada","capa protetora","horário da loja"],"ans":0,"why":"**cracked screen** = tela trincada."},{"q":"What does “protective case” mean?","opts":["ponto de ônibus","capa protetora","tempo de espera"],"ans":1,"why":"**protective case** = capa protetora."},{"q":"What does “bus stop” mean?","opts":["horário da loja","equipe simpática","ponto de ônibus"],"ans":2,"why":"**bus stop** = ponto de ônibus."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}